config COMPARATOR_GD32_LVD
	bool "GigaDevice GD32 low voltage detector"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_GD_GD32_LVD_ENABLED
	select GD32_EXTI
	help
	  Expose the low voltage detector (LVD) of GigaDevice GD32 SoCs
	  through the comparator API: the output is high while the supply is
	  below the programmed threshold, and crossing the threshold in either
	  direction can trigger a callback.
